en:
From the root, from the aggregates, and also from the doors, and also from the planes;
From the meaning, from the phenomena, and also from the names, and also from the characteristics;
Because it is taught having been arranged,
It is called the Summary.

pt:
“Através de incontáveis renascimentos no saṃsāra, transmigrei sem encontrar,
Buscando o construtor desta casa;
Doloroso é renascer repetidamente.”
